    50	#   the lane's foreign compute processes must EQUAL that identity tuple (exp35_gpu_identity.py --check, the
    51	#   bytes re-hashed at every check) at the selection, the pre-spawn re-check and -- for every exp_35 cell --
    52	#   once more inside run_cell right before the launcher (a change there: exit 2, no receipt).
    53	#
    54	# Written by the exp_25 Coder seat (Claude Opus 5.5, max effort) per plan_depth_canon.md v9 §5.
